pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  # ===== NAV BAR =====
  - elementId: nav-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"

  - elementId: nav-active
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [640, 0, 320, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: nav-t1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [0, 0, 320, 40]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>维度一: Source</p>

  - elementId: nav-t2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [320, 0, 320, 40]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>维度二: Propagation</p>

  - elementId: nav-t3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 0, 320, 40]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>维度三: Sink</p>

  - elementId: nav-t4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [960, 0, 320, 40]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>维度四: Verification</p>

  - elementId: nav-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 40, 1280, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  # ===== TITLE & BADGE =====
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 54, 880, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>IoTScope — 静态枚举与黑盒验证隐藏接口</p>

  - elementId: badge-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [1050, 58, 170, 28]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: badge-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1050, 58, 170, 28]
    content:
      style: "$badge"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>WWW 2022</p>

  # ===== LEFT COLUMN: 内容摘要 & 研究背景 =====
  - elementId: left-bar-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 108, 4, 24]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: left-subtitle-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [72, 106, 348, 28]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>内容摘要</p>

  - elementId: left-body-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 142, 360, 190]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>面向IoT隐藏接口的静态枚举与黑盒验证框架。从固件提取路径构造候选URL，通过双子请求和响应聚类识别未保护接口，结合参数差分和敏感关键词确认配置修改与信息泄露漏洞。</p>

  - elementId: left-bar-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 348, 4, 24]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: left-subtitle-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [72, 346, 348, 28]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>研究背景</p>

  - elementId: left-body-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 382, 360, 230]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>传统工具缺乏Web接口访问控制检测。核心挑战：①接口枚举困难——形态多样且硬编码；②未保护接口识别困难——服务器不遵守标准状态码；③隐藏属性判定困难——触发不崩溃，缺乏反馈信号。</p>

  # ===== MIDDLE COLUMN: 核心洞察 & 解决方案 =====
  - elementId: mid-bar-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [440, 108, 4, 24]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: mid-subtitle-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [452, 106, 348, 28]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>核心洞察</p>

  - elementId: mid-body-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [440, 142, 360, 250]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>①隐藏接口残留在固件或二进制中，可静态提取底层线索生成候选URL；②发现URL不等于安全问题，关键在判断匿名用户能否访问配置或敏感信息；③HTTP状态码不可靠，需用响应内容相似度聚类过滤伪404；④配置修改类通过带参/无参差分确认，信息泄露类通过敏感关键词匹配。</p>

  - elementId: mid-bar-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [440, 400, 4, 24]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: mid-subtitle-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [452, 398, 348, 28]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>解决方案</p>

  - elementId: mid-body-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [440, 434, 360, 250]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>1. 接口枚举：从固件提取路径与文件名，交叉组合构造候选URL（平均6.2万/固件）。2. 双子请求：发送带认证与无认证请求，响应差异大则受保护。3. 响应聚类：基于字符串相似度分组，剔除多数派无效路径。4. 精准判定：配置修改类通过参数差分测试，信息泄露类通过敏感关键词匹配。</p>

  # ===== RIGHT COLUMN: 关键数据 =====
  - elementId: right-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [820, 108, 4, 24]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: right-subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [832, 106, 348, 28]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>关键数据</p>

  # Card 1
  - elementId: card1-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [840, 150, 340, 120]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$panel"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: card1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 165, 300, 42]
    content:
      style: "$kpi"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>17</p>

  - elementId: card1-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 215, 300, 24]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>台真实设备</p>

  # Card 2
  - elementId: card2-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [840, 290, 340, 120]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$panel"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: card2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 305, 300, 42]
    content:
      style: "$kpi"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>44</p>

  - elementId: card2-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 355, 300, 24]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>个漏洞</p>

  # Card 3
  - elementId: card3-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [840, 430, 340, 120]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$panel"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: card3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 445, 300, 42]
    content:
      style: "$kpi"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>43</p>

  - elementId: card3-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 495, 300, 24]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>个未知漏洞</p>

  # ===== FOOTER =====
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 690, 400, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>网络设备Web服务安全研究</p>

  - elementId: footer-right
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1100, 690, 120, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
